contentText:
Ferg stopped by Complex to sit down with In Motion With Ashley Nicole Moss and has responded to A$AP Rocky telling Apple Music&#8217;s Ebro that he felt &#8220;bothered&#8221; by Ferg deciding to drop the A$AP from his stage name earlier this year .

“I haven’t seen Ferg in a minute, man,” Rocky said after being asked about their current relationship. “I’mma be totally honest. I haven’t even been living in New York. I always love Ferg. Ferg, he got a good heart. I saw a couple interviews where he was just like, he ain’t A$AP and he dropped A$AP from his name. That sh&#8211; bothered me but I ain’t gon’ hold it against him, and I wish him the best.”

